Revision history for HTTP-VWF

0.01
	First release.
	VWF (Versatile Web Framework) repackaged as a CPAN distribution,
	with its modules renamed from VWF:: to HTTP::VWF:: so that the
	namespace matches the distribution name.
	Sites that were each carrying their own renamed copy of VWF
	(ged2site, pds, Geo::Coder::Free, syslogd and the bandsman.co.uk,
	concert-bands.co.uk and nigelhorne.com websites) can now depend on
	this distribution instead.
	Nothing has been changed on the way in: the code is VWF's, with the
	namespace and the template directory path (templates/.../VWF/Display
	is now templates/.../HTTP/VWF/Display) changed and nothing else.
